            "pages": {
              "end": 39,
              "start": 39
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Alito, justice Alito questioned whether the petitioners\u2019 theory applied to any system of data dissemination."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6ab8ec21006ec8570d912efa69199859f3cbda0c74cea37ba4b0609d14a02c90",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-6ab8ec21006e-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 39,
              "start": 39
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito followed up, asking whether a prosecutor\u2019s policy of not distributing recent Ninth Circuit or Supreme Court decisions on criminal constitutional procedure would be a valid theory."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6ab8ec21006ec8570d912efa69199859f3cbda0c74cea37ba4b0609d14a02c90",
